{"id":"4bc7b266-ebe1-4aa3-84f4-df96ff7a07bb","expr":"args != null","rationale":"The main entry point is always invoked by the JVM with a non-null array of arguments.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.example.Main#main(String[]):void","file":"com/example/Main.java","createdAt":"2026-04-17T15:24:33.939631Z"}
{"id":"95e95e60-ce95-4074-bf75-0dcebaf9ec04","expr":"args != null","rationale":"String[] args is never explicitly set to null and is provided by the JVM; it should never be null at method exit.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"com.example.Main#main(String[]):void","file":"com/example/Main.java","createdAt":"2026-04-17T15:24:33.939975Z"}
{"id":"32f31cf2-d68e-42e4-88cb-e39b68e4ce3d","expr":"args.length >= 0","rationale":"By Java specification, any array's length is always greater than or equal to zero.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.example.Main#main(String[]):void","file":"com/example/Main.java","createdAt":"2026-04-17T15:24:33.939631Z"}
{"id":"b98b70cb-e464-4219-a220-9c7b204e0e1a","expr":"name != null || result == -1","rationale":"If name is null, the function always returns -1.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"com.example.Foo#bar(int,String):int","file":"com/example/Foo.java","createdAt":"2026-04-17T15:24:33.941438Z"}
{"id":"36effa80-c2c4-432d-b02e-1c741660deec","expr":"args.length >= 0","rationale":"Array length is always non-negative in Java.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"com.example.Main#main(String[]):void","file":"com/example/Main.java","createdAt":"2026-04-17T15:24:33.939975Z"}
{"id":"1df52cb6-1735-426d-ac12-4152d5891585","expr":"name == null || result == x + name.length()","rationale":"If name is not null, result is always x plus name.length().","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"com.example.Foo#bar(int,String):int","file":"com/example/Foo.java","createdAt":"2026-04-17T15:24:33.941438Z"}
{"id":"329ed52b-476e-4d2b-b60f-45a26f1b2308","expr":"result >= -1","rationale":"The minimal possible result is -1 (when name==null).","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"com.example.Foo#bar(int,String):int","file":"com/example/Foo.java","createdAt":"2026-04-17T15:24:33.941438Z"}
{"id":"8bf7cc74-f928-45e5-ae39-a28b2d04eb6e","expr":"name == null || name.length() >= 0","rationale":"String.length() is always non-negative, but call is only safe if name is non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.example.Foo#bar(int,String):int","file":"com/example/Foo.java","createdAt":"2026-04-17T15:24:33.942365Z"}
{"id":"086b8c4c-bf2b-481a-8be4-8f7bd0260ef1","expr":"name == null || result >= x","rationale":"If name is not null, name.length() is at least 0, so result >= x.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"com.example.Foo#bar(int,String):int","file":"com/example/Foo.java","createdAt":"2026-04-17T15:24:33.941438Z"}
{"id":"45a86725-e9ba-4d28-b154-06350a97e8d8","expr":"name == null || x + name.length() >= x","rationale":"If name is not null, name.length() >= 0, so the sum is at least x.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.example.Foo#bar(int,String):int","file":"com/example/Foo.java","createdAt":"2026-04-17T15:24:33.942365Z"}
{"id":"a5296975-ce29-478f-9cbe-ff6f74dfc1b2","expr":"name == null || x + name.length() >= name.length()","rationale":"If name is not null, x + name.length() is at least name.length().","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.example.Foo#bar(int,String):int","file":"com/example/Foo.java","createdAt":"2026-04-17T15:24:33.942365Z"}
{"id":"dc55a1b0-9a0e-4038-9c93-4e5d2ed3e7c5","expr":"x + (name == null ? 0 : name.length()) >= x","rationale":"Using a safe evaluation, the sum is never less than x.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.example.Foo#bar(int,String):int","file":"com/example/Foo.java","createdAt":"2026-04-17T15:24:33.942365Z"}
{"id":"6944fdfe-3376-4d36-9173-34f6e6a5b95b","expr":"x + (name == null ? 0 : name.length()) >= (name == null ? 0 : name.length())","rationale":"The sum is never less than name.length() (or 0 if name is null).","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.example.Foo#bar(int,String):int","file":"com/example/Foo.java","createdAt":"2026-04-17T15:24:33.942365Z"}
